Description: Find duplicate files with various contents
 dupeGuru is a cross-platform GUI tool to find duplicate files in a system. It
 can scan filenames or contents, has a special mode for music files with tag
 comparison and one for pictures that finds similar, not only identical images.
 .
 This build uses PySide6 (Qt 6) for its user interface.
